### 1.1 — Listar authors
GET http://localhost:3001/authors

### 1.1 — Crear author
POST http://localhost:3001/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Julio Cortázar", "nationality": "Argentina" }

### 1.2 — Detalle
GET http://localhost:3001/authors/1

### 1.2 — 404
GET http://localhost:3001/authors/999

### 1.3 — Filtro por query param
GET http://localhost:3001/authors?nationality=Argentina

### 2.1 — Books de una collection (subrecurso)
GET http://localhost:3001/collections/1/books

### 2.2 — Mismos books, por query param
GET http://localhost:3001/books?collectionId=1

### 2.3 — Agregar un book a una collection
POST http://localhost:3001/collections/1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bookId": 3 }

### 2.3 — Sacar un book de una collection
DELETE http://localhost:3001/collections/1/books/1

### 4.1 — Crear collection (Zod)
POST http://localhost:3001/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ciencia ficción" }

### 4.1 — Body inválido a propósito
POST http://localhost:3001/collections
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5.1 — Borrar un author
DELETE http://localhost:3001/authors/2

### 5.3 — Actualización parcial (Zod)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/authors/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nationality": "España" }

### 4.2 / 5.4 — Documentación generada (Swagger UI) — abrir en el navegador
GET http://localhost:3001/docs
